  "settingsAiDisclosure": "When this is on and you ask OpenRouter for a suggestion, the app sends openrouter.ai and the model provider, with your own API key: the brand, palette mode and scene, the base marker's code and name and whether it is locked, the palette size, the codes and hex colours of the candidate markers, the model settings and the app's fixed instructions. Photos are never sent: this feature has no image upload. On Android, the app may also ask Google's ML Kit whether Gemini Nano is available; ML Kit sends Google usage diagnostics. Nothing at all is sent while this switch is off.",
